    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_962 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔\n      ∃ ε : ℕ → ℝ,\n        (∀ δ > 0, ∀ᶠ n in atTop, |ε n| < δ) ∧\n        ∀ᶠ n : ℕ in atTop,\n          log (k n : ℝ)\n            ≤ rpow (log n) ((1 : ℝ) / 2 + ε n)",
